G2270.def:
ἡσυχάζω 
[in LXX chiefly for שָׁקַט ;] 
to be still; 
__(a) to rest from labour: Luc 23:56; 
__(b) to live quietly: 1 Thessaloniciens 4:11; 
__(with) to be silent: Luc 14:3, Actes 11:18 21:14 (cf. Job 32:7, Néhémie 5:8).†
SYN.: σιγάω (which see), σιωπάω
